<p>This page is somewhat redundant as it duplicates things from pages such as <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Installation%20troubleshooting" title="Installation troubleshooting">Installation troubleshooting</a>.  However, it is gathering place for issues related to specific builds, along with plans to fix them.
</p><p>We're now moving detailed bug reports to individual pages, grouped in the category <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Category%20-%20Toolset%20bugs" title="Category:Toolset bugs">Toolset bugs</a>. See <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Reporting%20a%20bug" title="Reporting a bug">Reporting a bug</a> for instructions on how to submit bugs. This page will remain as a high-level summary of current known issues.
</p>
