<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Build_1.0.1008.0_.28Installer_Version_1.01.29">Build 1.0.1008.0 (Installer Version 1.01)</span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Installer_Issues">Installer Issues</span></h3>
<ul><li><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20Cannot%20open%20file%20for%20writing%20C%20-%20Program%20Files%20-%20BioWare" title="Bug: Cannot open file for writing C:\Program Files\BioWare\...">Bug: Cannot open file for writing C:\Program Files\BioWare\...</a></li></ul>
<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="Unable_to_connect_to_the_database"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Unable%20to%20connect%20to%20the%20database" title="Unable to connect to the database">Unable to connect to the database</a></span></h4>
<p>Unfortunately this will always be a potential issue, as it is an issue with connecting to SQL Server 2005 Express, which can fail in as many ways as there are users.  The latest help can be found <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Unable%20to%20connect%20to%20the%20database" title="Unable to connect to the database">here</a>.
</p>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Toolset_Issues_2">Toolset Issues</span></h3>
<ul><li><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20SpeedTree%20rendering%20distance" title="Bug: SpeedTree rendering distance">Bug: SpeedTree rendering distance</a> - it has been reported that in at least one case a user can't set his tree rendering distance above 20m.</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20ConfigureToolset%20application%20fails%20to%20set%20a%20registry%20key" title="Bug: ConfigureToolset application fails to set a registry key">Bug: ConfigureToolset application fails to set a registry key </a>. This bug requires a workaround if you need to use ConfigureToolset to change your database settings.</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20Computer%20names%20with%20non-English%20characters%20can%20cause%20checkout%20problems" title="Bug: Computer names with non-English characters can cause checkout problems">Bug: Computer names with non-English characters can cause checkout problems</a>. This can cause checked-out resources to be recognized as checked out to the wrong user, making them impossible to edit.</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20Unable%20to%20save%20a%20new%20module" title="Bug: Unable to save a new module">Bug: Unable to save a new module</a>. This can occur for users with long usernames.</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20Water%20plane%20missing%20in-game" title="Bug: Water plane missing in-game">Bug: Water plane missing in-game</a>. Level art that's posted when not in the single player module is missing its water planes.</li></ul>
