<li><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20Lightmapper%20causes%20shading%20artifacts%20along%20chunk%20boundaries" title="Bug: Lightmapper causes shading artifacts along chunk boundaries">Bug: Lightmapper causes shading artifacts along chunk boundaries</a></li>
